posterImage\":\"znb2l244e2800fkcmytqldvebnqn\",\"bannerImage\":\"jc14h8v8d9lg6mhytlpbiglgulx2\",\"synopsis\":\"Get ready to laugh your way into the weekend with our brand-new Friday night Open Mic at Throwley Yard Cinema, in partnership with Comedy Lounge! Every Friday, we're opening our stage to up-and-coming comedians and anyone who's ever wanted to give live stand-up comedy a shot.\\n\\nWhether you're a budding comedian looking for a platform to showcase your talent or someone who loves a good laugh, our Open Mic night is the perfect opportunity to be part of Sutton's vibrant cultural scene. Enjoy a night of spontaneous humour, fresh talent, and community spirit in the heart of Throwley Yard Cinema.\\n\\nWhy join us?\\n•\\tFor Comedians: Hone your craft in front of a supportive audience, gain invaluable stage experience, and network with fellow performers. It's a fantastic way to build your confidence and grow your comedic skills. To perform, sign-up \\\"https://www.instagram.com/comedyloungeofficial/\\\" \\n•\\tFor the Community: Experience the joy of live entertainment, support local talent, and connect with neighbours in a lively, inclusive environment. Laughs are guaranteed, and who knows—you might witness the rise of the next big comedy star!\\n\\nThe event is free, however please consider a small donation on the night which goes towards supporting and developing our  local comedians,. These nights are popular and seats are limited so we recommend you book in advance at the link below. Sign up now for your tickets and be part of a night that's sure to bring the house down with laughter. \\n\\nCome join us at Throwley Yard Cinema every Friday and let the good times roll with Comedy Lounge's Open Mic night. We can't wait to see you there!\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":\"Live Event\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\